<title>USA: MFS Communications reaches Florida pact.</title>
<headline>MFS Communications reaches Florida pact.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb. 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>MFS Communications Inc said Friday it entered into a local telephone service co-carrier connection agreement with BellSouth Corp covering Florida.</p>
<p>The companies said they expect to execute a similar agreement covering the state of Georgia later on Friday.</p>
<p>The agreement includes minimum points of interconnection, a single equal, identical and reciprocal rate for termination of local calls and interim number portability.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
